vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软发布MDASH多模型智能体扫描框架，漏洞检测能力超越GPT-5.5</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta在WhatsApp及Meta AI应用中发布搭载Muse Spark模型的隐身模式</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic企业级市场份额达34.4%首次超越OpenAI</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴发布2026财年Q4财报：百炼平台ARR即将突破百亿元大关</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4ea9cdeb54d049847faaa245ff4d2092.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴2026财年Q4财报显示，公司营收达2433.8亿元，AI驱动的云业务进入爆发期。核心产品阿里云“百炼”MaaS平台年化经常性收入（ARR）已突破80亿元，预计本季度将跨越100亿元大关。增长主要由通义千问系列模型API服务及AI原生软件订阅驱动，其中AI编程与复杂任务Agent需求激增，带动平台流量半年内增长超10倍。管理层宣布将建设规模为2022年十倍以上的“AI训练与推理工厂”，通过平头哥全栈芯片与模型的深度协同，提升国产算力渗透率。尽管大额资本开支影响短期自由现金流，但服务器资源长期满载。此次财报明确了阿里从传统IaaS向高毛利MaaS及AI应用层转型的战略，旨在通过技术架构升级构筑智算时代市场护城河。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">脉脉发布2026春招报告：具身智能岗位激增15倍，AI科学家月薪超13万元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9c890e99ed5addd286fc9001673230f1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">脉脉发布的2026年春招职场报告显示，我国AI行业人才需求爆发，2026年1月至4月AI岗位总量同比激增8.7倍。其中，具身智能领域成为核心引擎，岗位需求同比暴涨15倍。在薪资方面，具身智能岗位平均月薪由5.9万元提升至6.2万元。AI科学家及负责人以132,796元的平均月薪位居新经济行业榜首，成为唯一月薪破10万元的职位。此外，算法研究员、AI Infra、系统架构师、大模型算法及AIGC算法工程师等岗位薪资均保持高位增长。报告指出，AI产业竞争重心已从基础架构搭建转向垂直应用落地与物理交互。具身智能作为AI与机器人学深度融合的产物，其人才缺口的扩大标志着感知、决策与执行一体化的智能化浪潮加速到来。高端人才向关键技术节点的集聚，将直接决定企业在大模型产业下半场的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布MDASH多模型智能体扫描框架，漏洞检测能力超越GPT-5.5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3f34e5dee2b36963b5632cf956de2b1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软自主代码安全团队于5月13日推出MDASH多模型智能体扫描框架，通过整合超过100个专用AI智能体实现协同工作。该系统覆盖代码准备、漏洞扫描、验证及补丁生成等全流程。在CyberGym基准测试中，MDASH表现优于Anthropic的Mythos模型及OpenAI的GPT-5.5，成功挖掘出16个新漏洞，含4个高危远程代码执行漏洞。在私有测试中，MDASH实现100%漏洞识别率且零误报。回顾性测试显示，其对clfs.sys及tcpip.sys的历史漏洞召回率分别高达96%和100%。目前，MDASH已用于微软内部产品安全加固，并面向受限客户开启内部预览。该框架通过多智能体协作策略，显著提升了代码安全检测的准确性与效率，为行业漏洞挖掘提供了新范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta在WhatsApp及Meta AI应用中发布搭载Muse Spark模型的隐身模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96ed66835bd5850d463b665cb50a5ef2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta于2026年5月13日正式在WhatsApp及独立Meta AI应用中推出“隐身模式”（Incognito Mode）。该模式旨在解决大模型交互中的隐私留存痛点，用户开启后，对话记录将不被存储，系统会在关闭聊天窗口、锁定屏幕或退出应用时自动终止会话并清除上下文信息。技术层面，该功能放弃了旧版小型模型，转而搭载4月发布的最新Muse Spark模型，并依托Meta私有处理基础设施，在不破坏端到端加密协议的前提下提供算力支持。WhatsApp产品副总裁Alice Newton-Rex表示，此举旨在应对AI聊天记录合规性风险。此外，Meta正研发“侧边聊天”（Side Chat）功能，支持在群组中私下调用AI进行辅助决策。通过底层架构与交互模式升级，Meta正试图重塑生成式AI在社交生态中的信任边界，推动大模</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic企业级市场份额达34.4%首次超越OpenAI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">支付平台Ramp发布的最新AI指数报告显示，Anthropic在B2B付费企业应用市场的份额已攀升至34.4%，首次超过OpenAI的32.3%。过去一年中，Anthropic市场占有率实现四倍增长，而OpenAI增速仅为0.3%。该数据基于通过Ramp平台支付的美国企业AI支出。尽管Anthropic取得领先，但仍面临利润结构矛盾、服务稳定性波动及Opus 4.7模型图像处理成本激增等挑战。与此同时，OpenAI正通过GPT-5.5 Pro进行反击，该模型具备极强的数学研究能力，但其价格上涨了92%。当前AI市场竞争格局剧烈变动，Kimi K2.6等模型正挑战现有智能体集群，企业客户对高成本方案的粘性正面临严峻考验，市场已进入群雄并起的动态竞争阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
